But within one year, AI will outperform 99.8% of real estate professionals =
at site selection.

Not because people aren't smart. But because the game has changed:

1. There is more data on land + markets now than any person can process
2. That data is growing every single day
3. AI can screen, filter, and rank sites at a scale no analyst can match

Developers who understand this aren't replacing their teams.=20
They're multiplying productivity with AI that flags the best opportunities =
from thousands of parcels in seconds.


The job isn't going away. But it is rapidly changing.=20

And the expectation for how many sites you can analyze and how deeply you a=
nalyze them is growing.

